# The writer stores a numeric seq id and the reader treats a missing
# entity id as residue 0 (0.10.4 wrote "." and then dereferenced the
# absent label_entity_id column). A whitespace line or a tag without a
# value is skipped or an error, never indexed. The writer prints "?" for
# an empty value and replaces whitespace inside one, so a row keeps its
# columns; the reader maps "?" and "." back to empty names and types.
# A row with the wrong column count, a row without its model column, and
# a table without coordinates or atom labels are errors.
